{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Mad Metal Demo includes 2 playable vehicles, a short tutorial, and 4 hand-crafted arena-style levels that culminate in a massive boss fight. It has approximately 30 minutes of content and does not include a campaign/story mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chaos Fingerprint</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Physics-based interactions allow for hundreds of unique explosions and cinematic fatalities.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667330/extras/gif2.gif?t=1745736856\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dead Aim </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use precision targeting to disable vital components and cripple the opposition. </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667330/extras/gif1.gif?t=1745736856\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Meaningful Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vehicles have unique Active and Passive abilities that fundamentally alter the game, like the police grapple hook.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667330/extras/gif-4.gif?t=1745736856\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dynamic Foliage and Seasons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your vehicle interacts with the foliage in the environment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667330/extras/gif3.gif?t=1745736856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*With GPU and CPU performance in mind, precalculated physics interactions adaptively reduce your gaming device's real-time hardware demand.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete in 5-minute deathmatches that culminate in a challenging boss-fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667330/extras/gif---boss-fight.gif?t=1745736856\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deep Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock, equip, and upgrade components to enhance vehicle performance. Obtain powerful vehicle and weapon augments hidden throughout the battlefield.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>FAQ</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Will this be released for consoles?</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> PC, PS5, and Xbox. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Deck and VR support are unconfirmed at this time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Will it have gamepad and wheel support?</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes and yes. However, early demo builds  may not have full controller support.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667330?t=1745736856","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667330/7125a936e05ce7fcf10711a1a0b98f814444c8bd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745736856","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667330/c5c7923fd83d824b92e26f410ac0187d1cfaeddd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745736856","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667330/c5c7923fd83d824b92e26f410ac0187d1cfaeddd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745736856","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Mad Metal Demo includes 2 playable vehicles, a short tutorial, and 4 hand-crafted arena-style levels that culminate in a massive boss fight. It has approximately 30 minutes of content and does not include a campaign/story mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chaos Fingerprint</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Physics-based interactions allow for hundreds of unique explosions and cinematic fatalities.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667330/extras/gif2.gif?t=1745736856\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dead Aim </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use precision targeting to disable vital components and cripple the opposition. </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667330/extras/gif1.gif?t=1745736856\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Meaningful Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vehicles have unique Active and Passive abilities that fundamentally alter the game, like the police grapple hook.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667330/extras/gif-4.gif?t=1745736856\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dynamic Foliage and Seasons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your vehicle interacts with the foliage in the environment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667330/extras/gif3.gif?t=1745736856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*With GPU and CPU performance in mind, precalculated physics interactions adaptively reduce your gaming device's real-time hardware demand.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete in 5-minute deathmatches that culminate in a challenging boss-fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667330/extras/gif---boss-fight.gif?t=1745736856\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deep Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock, equip, and upgrade components to enhance vehicle performance. Obtain powerful vehicle and weapon augments hidden throughout the battlefield.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>FAQ</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Will this be released for consoles?</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> PC, PS5, and Xbox. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Deck and VR support are unconfirmed at this time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Will it have gamepad and wheel support?</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes and yes. However, early demo builds  may not have full controller support.</p>","developers":["Hakim Elayday"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3068230","name":"Mad Metal"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667330/6f45e40f9219ee4410c64e9a6b910ce04692593e/header.jpg?t=1745736856","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125429,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125429/movie480.mp4?t=1745349480","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125429/movie_max.mp4?t=1745349480"},"name":"Gameplay Teaser 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125429/490527bf61e4b84dd95daa1e8c62644bc665df67/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745349480","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125429/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745349480","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125429/movie_max_vp9.